<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu falls to 4.614 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu falls to 4.614 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu fell to 4.6140 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.6135 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 25		  Oct 24</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.6140		  4.6135</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    50,000		  25,000</p>
<p>				    Oct 25		  Oct 16</p>
<p> lei per 1,000 roubles	0.8440		  0.8450</p>
<p> volume traded (million rbls)   100		     50</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
